        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=-\\frac{1}{7}x$",
          "worked": "Using $y=mx+c$ with $m=-\\frac{1}{7}$ and $c=0$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=-\\frac{1}{7}x+0\\\\y&=-\\frac{1}{7}x.\\end{align*}$$",
